<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= property.title %> | AI Analiz Raporu</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #0F172A; --accent: #10B981; --risk: #EF4444; --bg: #F8FAFC; }
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); margin: 0; color: #1E293B; }
        
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
        
        /* Sol Taraf: İlan Detayları */
        .listing-main { background: white; border-radius: 30px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
        .main-img { width: 100%; height: 500px; object-fit: cover; }
        .listing-content { padding: 40px; }
        .price-big { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .specs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9; padding-top: 30px; }
        .spec-item { text-align: center; background: #F1F5F9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 15px; }

        /* Sağ Taraf: AI Analiz Paneli */
        .ai-sidebar { position: sticky; top: 30px; }
        .ai-card { background: var(--primary); color: white; border-radius: 30px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2); }
        .score-circle { width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 5px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 auto 20px; }
        .analysis-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .pro-con { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }
        .badge { padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
        .badge-plus { background: #065F46; color: #34D399; }
        .badge-minus { background: #7F1D1D; color: #F87171; }

        .back-btn { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; text-decoration: none; color: #64748B; font-weight: 600; }
        @media (max-width: 968px) { .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="listing-area">
            <a href="/" class="back-btn"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Galeriye Dön</a>
            
            <div class="listing-main">
                <img src="<%= property.img %>" class="main-img">
                <div class="listing-content">
                    <span style="color: #64748B; font-weight: 600;"><%= property.city %> / <%= property.location %></span>
                    <h1 style="margin: 10px 0; font-size: 32px;"><%= property.title %></h1>
                    <div class="price-big"><%= property.price %> ₺</div>
                    
                    <p style="color: #475569; line-height: 1.8;"><%= property.details.desc %></p>

                    <div class="specs-grid">
                        <div class="spec-item"><i class="fas fa-expand-arrows-alt"></i><br><strong><%= property.details.m2 %> m²</strong></div>
                        <div class="spec-item"><i class="fas fa-building"></i><br><strong><%= property.details.age %> Yaşında</strong></div>
                        <div class="spec-item"><i class="fas fa-thermometer-half"></i><br><strong><%= property.details.heating %></strong></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-sidebar">
            <div class="ai-card">
                <div style="text-align: center;">
                    <div class="score-circle">88</div>
                    <h3 style="margin: 0;">EmlakIQ Yatırım Skoru</h3>
                    <p style="color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px;">Piyasa verileriyle hesaplanmıştır</p>
                </div>

                <div class="analysis-box">
                    <div style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Piyasa Analizi</div>
                    Bu mülk, <%= property.city %> bölge ortalamasının %4 altında fiyatlandırılmış. 2 yıl içinde %35 değer artışı öngörülüyor.
                </div>

                <div class="analysis-box">
                    <div style="color: #F87171; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i> Risk Analizi</div>
                    Zemin etüdü onaylı ancak bina yaşı nedeniyle amortisman süresi 18 yıl olarak hesaplanmıştır.
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 25px;">
                    <div class="pro-con"><span class="badge badge-plus">+</span> <span style="font-size: 13px;">Yüksek kira çarpanı</span></div>
                    <div class="pro-con"><span class="badge badge-plus">+</span> <span style="font-size: 13px;">Metro hattına yakınlık</span></div>
                    <div class="pro-con"><span class="badge badge-minus">-</span> <span style="font-size: 13px;">Ortak gider maliyeti</span></div>
                </div>

                <button style="width: 100%; margin-top: 30px; padding: 15px; border-radius: 15px; border: none; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer;">
                    PROFESYONEL RAPORU İNDİR (.PDF)
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>